Modifications from the upstream work: rebranded from Multi to Switchboard;
the Cursor, Antigravity and Grok integrations and the gpt-5.6-terra model
removed; OpenAI models moved to the gpt-6 ids (gpt-6-astra, gpt-6-sol,
gpt-6-luna); pinned reasoning-effort model rows with short picker labels added;
toolchain moved from Node, npm and Biome to Bun and oxlint.

