have been removed. These acknowledgments preserve their provenance.

The automatic reviewer includes OpenAI Codex Guardian policy assets under
src/providers/codex/guardian/, from https://github.com/openai/codex, licensed
under Apache 2.0. Their upstream LICENSE and NOTICE are included there.

The local token estimator uses js-tiktoken (https://github.com/dqbd/tiktoken),
licensed under MIT, with OpenAI tiktoken encoding data. Translator compatibility
behavior was researched against CLIProxyAPI; no gateway engine or authentication
implementation from that project is included.

